Package: ImageFilter
Title: Image Filter Package for RGB Colour Conversion
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Larissa", email = "larissa-k-g@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A package for applying colour filter to bitmap images. Contains functions to convert each pixel to greyscale, red, green or blue, as well as a pixelscanner that applies these filters to an entire image, pixel by pixel.
